WEBVTT

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:05.150
 『Mayu Declines』

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:05.150
 『Mayu Declines』

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.690
<b>Don't tell me... Oh no!</b>

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.690
<b>It's gone up so much.</b>

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.700
<b>I have to go on a diet!</b>

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.210
<b>You're not going to eat?</b>

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:27.540
<b>Well, I don't have much of an appetite today.</b>

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:32.920
<b>I see. So my cooking doesn't suit your tastes.</b>

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.220
<b>No, not at all.</b>

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.510
<b>My appetite has suddenly returned.</b>

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:41.180
<b>Your meals are really good, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.890
<b>I can eat any amount.</b>

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:53.780
<b>Here, eat to your heart's delight today as well.</b>

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:59.240
<b>I'm going to reach the point of no return soon...</b>

