00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.960
Episode 6

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.960
Remember

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.960
Episode 6

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:34.960
Remember

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.980
<b>What's the meaning of this?</b>

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:55.230
<b>No idea.</b>

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:58.240
<b>What do you mean by "no idea"?</b>

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:03.950
<b>On top of being raided by those men with that kind of equipment, we've been captured in this manner as well.</b>

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:06.620
<b>It's natural to think that something is out of place.</b>

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:11.870
<b>Well, if my Nee-san{sister} is the reason for all of this, then this isn't a surprise at all.</b>

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:19.510
<b>Certainly, that woman probably does all sorts of suspicious things around the world.</b>

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:24.760
<b>And also myself. I have many enemies who despise us.</b>

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:25.890
<b>You too?</b>

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:31.020
<b>That's the burden of being part of the Houjou Corporation.</b>

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:45.530
<b><i>Ninomiya-kun and Reika-san...</i></b>

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:50.620
<b>Tsukimura-san?</b>

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:56.840
<b>Yes, what is it, Ninomiya-kun?</b>

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:00.260
<b>You've been rather quiet. Is something the matter?</b>

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:05.680
<b>Well, I was thinking of how to get out of this mess.</b>

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:08.600
<b>I have some ideas on...</b>

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.350
<b>Please don't even consider it.</b>

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:13.640
<b>No matter what we consider,
we're up against professionals.</b>

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:19.900
<b>That's right. The ropes are tied in such a way
that I can't escape even if I dislocate my joints.</b>

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:27.580
<b>In other words, we will lose our lives if we make the wrong moves and provoke the enemy.</b>

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.910
<b>That's how it is.</b>

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:31.910
<b>O-Our lives?</b>

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:35.580
<b>It's no use being impatient, since we'll get out of this quickly somehow.</b>

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.040
<b>Let's save our strength for now.</b>

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:58.770
<b>What is it?</b>

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:02.030
<b>Commander, what is the purpose of this operation?</b>

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:06.200
<b>I had heard that it's better to avert danger before it happens.</b>

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.490
<b>And yet...</b>

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.950
<b>If you understand, then just keep your mouth shut and follow orders.</b>

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.120
<b>The danger is going to come soon.</b>

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.460
<b>Yes, ma'am.</b>

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.300
<b>I guess it's almost the time.</b>

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.100
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.</b>

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:41.110
<b>Hosaka-senpai? You got away?</b>

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.150
<b>For the time being.</b>

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:50.070
<b>So, did you learn anything?</b>

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:54.330
<b>I was probing around for clues, but I wasn't able to find anything definitive.</b>

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:59.830
<b>Then you should have come to save us earlier.</b>

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:02.130
<b>You're my attendant, aren't you?</b>

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:06.470
<b>Not much I could do. Only the defences in the cottage are tight.</b>

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:11.680
<b>It seems that their target hasn't appeared or something.</b>

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.470
<b>Which means, their target is...</b>

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.220
<b>My Nee-san{sister}, huh?</b>

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:16.770
<b>Or...</b>

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.980
<b>My brother? No, it can't be.</b>

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:24.020
<b>At any rate, our top priority is to get out of here.</b>

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:25.730
<b>Hosaka, let's go.</b>

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:28.150
<b>Yes, roger that!</b>

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:41.420
<b>Hosaka, where is the tight security you were talking about?</b>

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:44.630
<b>Hmm, that's odd.</b>

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:47.880
<b>That's right, we've got to get to the communicator, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.640
<b>Ah, the one my Nee-san{sister} left?</b>

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.560
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

00:06:55.560 --> 00:07:02.020
<b>Ryoko-san wrote in a memo to contact her with that if anything should happen.</b>

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:02.900
<b>So...</b>

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.610
<b>I wonder about that.</b>

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:08.780
<b>The enemy might have seen the memo as well. It might be dangerous.</b>

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:13.780
<b>But, but, the bad guys might do horrible things to Ryoko-san and my brother if we leave it like this.</b>

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:17.700
<b>That would never happen.</b>

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:21.750
<b>Yeah. Most likely, the ones who will suffer would be the bad guys.</b>

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:25.290
<b>Either way, let's go look for the communicator.</b>

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:31.590
<b>Tsukimura-san!</b>

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:37.850
<b>It's a toy, isn't it?</b>

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:41.060
<b>Tsukimura-san, are you all right?</b>

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:45.230
<b>I guess that's a warning.</b>

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:48.730
<b>If that was real, then...</b>

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.240
<b>Well, that was a learning experience.</b>

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.070
<b>Let's get out of here quickly.</b>

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:57.280
<b>Then, I'll take the lead this time.</b>

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.170
<b>Hosaka!</b>

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:13.340
<b>So, there are still rats left behind.</b>

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:18.180
<b>You bastard! How dare you!</b>

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:22.140
<b>You're going to challenge this many of us?</b>

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.230
<b>Damnit!</b>

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:31.650
<b>Houjou-senpai!</b>

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:35.740
<b>I will show you the true meaning of regret.</b>

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:41.950
<b>Tsukimura-san.</b>

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:44.870
<b>Senpai!</b>

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.080
<b>We're falling back.</b>

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:52.050
<b>What are you doing? I was going to avenge Hosaka.</b>

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:55.760
<b>They're getting away!</b>

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:56.890
<b>Pursue!</b>

00:08:58.640 --> 00:08:59.890
<b>Ojou-sama!</b>

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.640
<b>How long do you plan on lying there?</b>

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:15.990
<b>Let go of me, Ninomiya Shungo.</b>

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.820
<b>I still have a score to settle.</b>

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:20.530
<b>We have to get away first.</b>

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:22.950
<b>Stop!</b>

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:24.000
<b>This way!</b>

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.500
<b>Don't use your guns. Capture them alive!</b>

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:35.260
<b>Surrender quietly. There's nowhere to run.</b>

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:38.680
<b>Are we out of options?</b>

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.260
<b>Ninomiya-kun?</b>

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:45.520
<b>There's no forgiving what they have done.</b>

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.560
<b>I'm going to bring out my hammer of justice!</b>

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:52.070
<b>Forgive me, senpai.</b>

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:54.990
<b>Tsukimura-san, I'll deal with these guys here.</b>

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.110
<b>Please take senpai and run for it.</b>

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:58.700
<b>But...</b>

00:09:58.700 --> 00:09:59.990
<b>Don't argue. Hurry!</b>

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.750
<b>Ninomiya-kun...</b>

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:17.930
<b>I must buy them time.</b>

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.590
<b>Time to get serious.</b>

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:35.280
<b>What is he?</b>

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.820
<b>Just by himself...</b>

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.620
<b>That's impossible!</b>

00:10:57.090 --> 00:10:58.920
<b>It's been taken care of for the time being.</b>

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.700
<b>Wh-What?</b>

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:33.880
<b>So, you're finally awake, Ninomiya Shungo?</b>

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:37.380
<b>You're not the person from earlier, are you?</b>

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.670
<b>Where's that person who wore the strange mask?</b>

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:40.380
<b>I wouldn't know.</b>

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:43.930
<b>If your target is my Nee-san{sister}'s group, then they'll be coming back soon.</b>

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:46.390
<b>You should have no reason to attack us.</b>

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:49.520
<b>I do have a reason.</b>

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:50.890
<b>What do you mean?</b>

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.110
<b>Have your fun with him.</b>

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.320
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.280
<b>What reason do you have?</b>

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.200
<b>Damnit. Why you...</b>

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:17.170
<b><i>I'm sure something like this has happened before...</i></b>

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.720
<b>Ninomiya Shungo! How dare you...</b>

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:31.270
<b>Where am I?</b>

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:32.430
<b>Reika-san.</b>

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:34.980
<b>You...</b>

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:36.860
<b>Where are we?</b>

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:40.820
<b>Reika-san!</b>

00:12:41.490 --> 00:12:43.320
<b>Hey, what's going on?</b>

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.700
<b>Come on, let go, Tsukimura Mayu.</b>

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.710
<b>First, explain the situation.</b>

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.800
<b>It's my fault...</b>

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:08.430
<b>that Hosaka-san... and also
Ninomiya-kun didn't come back.</b>

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.980
<b><i>That fool... Again...</i></b>

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:23.690
<b>Reika-san, let's rescue Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:26.200
<b>I can't leave him like this.</b>

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.240
<b>You don't have to tell me.</b>

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:31.620
<b>Reika-san!</b>

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:36.670
<b>Will you be fine with just waiting for those two to return?</b>

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:39.130
<b>There's a possibility they can resolve all this.</b>

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.130
<b>It would be inadvisable for us to appear before the enemy.</b>

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:46.010
<b>It's okay. I'll do it.</b>

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:49.140
<b>If not, I'll... I'll...</b>

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.270
<b>Come on, get a grip.</b>

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:55.850
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.060
<b>Then, let's go.</b>

00:13:58.060 --> 00:13:59.360
<b>Right!</b>

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:15.200
<b>What the hell is that?</b>

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:31.550
<b>Why only me?</b>

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:35.680
<b>But this is part of the plan. I have to be strong!</b>

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.060
<b>Grab onto that!</b>

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:45.150
<b>It's okay. I won't do anything.</b>

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.650
<b>Come up.</b>

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:52.870
<b>You're not injured, right?</b>

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:56.120
<b>Right.</b>

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.330
<b>Really? That's good.</b>

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:02.130
<b>I have a child about your age as well.</b>

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.000
<b>Here.</b>

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:14.220
<b>Thank you for saving me.</b>

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.560
<b>Not at all...</b>

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.600
<b>Again...</b>

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.410
<b>What's wrong? What's the situation?</b>

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:42.790
<b><i>Save us! It's the devil! We can hear the cries of the devil!</i></b>

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:50.970
<b>Is that the devil?</b>

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:57.430
<b>How did it end up like this?</b>

00:16:02.810 --> 00:16:07.820
<b>Reika-san, what part of this even resembles a plan?</b>

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:12.450
<b>Even if she's doing it unconsciously, she's quite a dangerous weapon.</b>

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:15.740
<b>Well, it's going as predicted and
it created the best possible diversion.</b>

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:20.580
<b>I will not put the time you have given me to waste.</b>

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.510
<b>Ninomiya Shungo.</b>

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.220
<b>Why?</b>

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:49.150
<b>Why do you always, each and every time..</b>

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:58.370
<b>Houjou-senpai?</b>

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.330
<b>Why are you crying?</b>

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:06.830
<b>You idiot! Why?</b>

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:11.170
<b>Why do you always do things by yourself, just like last time?</b>

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:16.430
<b>I'm begging you...</b>

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:29.020
<b>Don't be so reckless, spring onion boy.</b>

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:35.950
<b>Don't smile like that, you spring onion boy.</b>

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:41.410
<b><i>That's right, I remember, in the past...</i></b>

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.040
<b><i>that was what she called me.</i></b>

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:51.670
<b>Make sure you don't forget. It's a promise.</b>

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.300
<b>I won't accept it if you forget.</b>

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:58.180
<b>I got it. I promise.</b>

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:02.100
<b><i>The important promise...</i></b>

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:09.850
<b>Senpai, you... It can't be...</b>

